    "details": "CVE-2026-119552: Uptime Kuma through 2.5.8 contains a race condition in\nthe Socket.IO first-run setup handler that allows unauthenticated\nattackers to create an additional administrator account. Attackers can\nsend concurrent setup requests during the bcrypt hashing window to\nbypass the empty user table check, then modify monitors, API keys, and\nenable disableAuth.\n",
